  BEFORE: The latest less the value one step before: a week for a weekly series, a month for a monthly one
  AFTER:  East, Midwest, Mountain, Pacific and South Central are the five storage regions of EIA's Weekly Natural Gas Storage Report, each a group of states. They are not the electricity regions of the section "The whole country" below, which are EIA's groups of balancing authorities: the Midwest there has other borders
  BEFORE: The value 52 weeks before for a weekly series (364 days, the same weekday, or the nearest within 3 days), as EIA's storage report sets a week beside the same week a year before; the same month a year before for a monthly
  AFTER:  The latest less the value one step before: a week for a weekly series, a month for a monthly one
  BEFORE: The period's change less the five-year average change of the same period
  AFTER:  The value 52 weeks before for a weekly series (364 days, the same weekday, or the nearest within 3 days), as EIA's storage report sets a week beside the same week a year before; the same month a year before for a monthly series. The price board's Year takes the newest value at least 365 days before, so for a weekly series its base can be a week older: the date of each base is on hover in both
  BEFORE: The last 52 values held: 52 weeks for a weekly series, 52 months (over four years) for a monthly one. A week or month not held is left out and the line closes over it, so a line can span more than 52 steps; each point's 
  AFTER:  The mean of the values 52, 104, 156, 208 and 260 weeks before (for a monthly series, the same month of the five years before), with their lowest and highest on hover; given only when all five are held. It stands for normal at this point of the year only for a series with a season and no trend. For production, which has grown, and for positioning, it measures the five years' trend, not the season; and where a series changed its level within the five years (New York's and SPP's oil burned for power fell to near zero from 2023), it stands for a level the series no longer has. Read the year before
  BEFORE: Source: EIA, Weekly Natural Gas Storage Report (eia_gas_storage_weekly). Open its seasonal chart.
